waos-webgpu-host

This crate is a modified copy of the wasi-gfx runtime's `wasi-webgpu-wasmtime` crate, with a
part of the runtime's `wasi-gfx-runtime-shared` crate folded in, taken from

    https://github.com/wasi-gfx/wasi-gfx-runtime
    revision 772bc344d3d0e24ba2d3ee29fc0033fc6ccea81d

and licensed, as the runtime is, under the Apache License, Version 2.0, with the LLVM
exception, in LICENSE.

The waos Authors changed it. Files changed from that revision, each saying so in its
first line:

    Cargo.toml                   renamed waos-webgpu-host, on wasmtime 50 and wgpu-core 30
    wit/world.wit                its comment
    src/lib.rs
    src/enum_conversions.rs
    src/flags_conversions.rs
    src/to_core_conversions.rs
    src/trait_impls.rs
    src/types.rs
    src/stream_pipe.rs           from wasi-gfx-runtime-shared's src/lib.rs, trimmed

Files added, by the waos Authors:

    src/buffer_mapping.rs
    src/canvas.rs
    src/command_encoding.rs
    src/compilation_info.rs
    src/device_loss.rs
    src/device_request.rs
    src/gpu_object.rs
    src/labels.rs
    README.md
    NOTICE

What each change does is in README.md.
